From: Peridot packet injection build
Subject: [PATCH] block: add missing ADIOS module license metadata

The ADIOS source has an SPDX GPL-2.0 header but omits MODULE_LICENSE(), which
causes modpost to fail when the boot image's extracted config enables ADIOS as a
module.

--- a/block/adios.c
+++ b/block/adios.c
@@ -2058,3 +2058,4 @@
 MODULE_ALIAS("mq-adios-iosched");
+MODULE_LICENSE("GPL");
 
 #define ADIOS_PROGNAME "Adaptive Deadline I/O Scheduler"
